{"tool_name":"mips-for-psfs","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The macro generates orthogonal projections from bead images along the lateral and axial dimensions which are displayed using a customized look-up-table to color code intensities. A Gaussian curve is fit to the intensity profile of a fluorescent bead image and full-with-at-half-maximum (FWHM) values are extracted, and listed next to theoretical values for comparison.&nbsp;</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The macro generates orthogonal projections from bead images along the lateral and axial dimensions which are displayed using a customized look-up-table to color code intensities. A Gaussian curve is fit to the intensity profile of a fluorescent bead image and full-with-at-half-maximum (FWHM) values are extracted, and listed next to theoretical values for comparison.&nbsp;</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-27T14:53:36+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-02-03T09:43:56+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4827,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"01ae95ce-e9c0-423e-8fcf-2fcaf4d88a3c","url":"/taxonomy/term/4827"},{"target_id":4826,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6e0577a8-e223-48fc-b01c-9f7e62c8dd01","url":"/taxonomy/term/4826"},{"target_id":4916,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"68beeace-a618-4b08-8a62-5787f4507a0b","url":"/taxonomy/term/4916"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1549187864,"last_comment_uid":43,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Laurent Gelman"},{"value":"Jens Rietdorf"}],"has_biological_terms":[{"target_id":5011,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"7d5f0fb9-d8d9-4bd1-bee1-86e8183c2580","url":"/taxonomy/term/5011"}],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"ha